OL,3,GNEWSA'I never thought I'd make it as an
OL,4,Aactor but now I'm up for a Bafta'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Scott Ellis Watson dropped drama
OL,7,Fin school he could never have guessed
OL,8,Fhe would one day be walking the red
OL,9,Fcarpet as a nominee at the Scottish
OL,10,FBaftas.
OL,12,FThe now 16-year-old thought acting was
OL,13,Fout of reach, and gave up the subject
OL,14,Fto focus on becoming a pilot, but after
OL,15,Fan acclaimed turn as the young John
OL,16,FDavidson in the hit movie I Swear, he
OL,17,Fwas rewarded with another prominent
OL,18,Frole in the movie adaptation of BBC
OL,19,Fdrama Ghosts.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
