OL,3,GNEWSA'I never thought I'd make it as an
OL,4,Aactor but now I'm up for a Bafta'
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott, from Bishopbriggs in East
OL,7,FDunbartonshire, tells BBC Scotland: "I
OL,8,Fjust never thought that film acting was
OL,9,Fa career that I could have done, so I
OL,10,Fnever really chased it. I didn't have
OL,11,Fthat faith in myself."
OL,13,FI Swear tells the true story of John
OL,14,FDavidson, a Galashiels boy who
OL,15,Fdeveloped severe Tourette's Syndrome as
OL,16,Fa teenager and went on to become a
OL,17,Fvocal campaigner for his illness,
OL,18,Fwinning an MBE in 2019 for his efforts.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
